# Kindle Oasis 2 (KOA2) SELinux file contexts.
# Only real device nodes belong here. sysfs attributes (frontlight, battery,
# EPDC) are labelled through genfscon in genfs_contexts, because a /sys/class
# entry in file_contexts never takes effect on a pseudo filesystem.
# No raw eMMC block-device labels are granted here.
/dev/graphics/fb0    u:object_r:graphics_device:s0
